":"3CA78B52-4A63-4307-925E-A964DAA06052"},{"Id":2008,"Title":"Non-Financial minute sheet","Category":2,"DescriptionHtml":"<p>hello<\/p>","AttachmentFileName":"Tableside_Waiter_App_Spec.docx","AttachmentStoredPath":"uploads\/2cd13ae877844bda855753854269e064.docx","IsConfidential":false,"CreatedByUserId":"90b76db0-f165-4f10-87fc-92d8f71b05b3","CreatedAt":"2026-08-03T08:49:58.7505861","Status":"Pending","Token":"224BE6BB-2A59-4DFF-A090-E801CDC4A6B1"},{"Id":3008,"Title":"Financial minute sheet","Category":1,"DescriptionHtml":"<p>this&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;test<\/p>","IsConfidential":false,"CreatedByUserId":"31597851-45ba-43f9-9c64-a9693d88854b","CreatedAt":"2026-08-05T10:02:31.2842576","Status":"Pending","Token":"5158DF05-2925-45C4-9A09-99A72BCFCE82"},{"Id":4015,"Title":"Proposed Acquisition of Cement Manufacturing Facility","Category":1,"DescriptionHtml":"<p>This&nbsp;minute&nbsp;sheet&nbsp;seeks&nbsp;approval&nbsp;to&nbsp;proceed&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;of&nbsp;[Target&nbsp;Company\/Plant&nbsp;Name],&nbsp;a&nbsp;cement&nbsp;manufacturing&nbsp;facility&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;[location].<\/p><p><strong>Background:<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;The&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;aligns&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;company&#39;s&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;objective&nbsp;to&nbsp;expand&nbsp;its&nbsp;footprint&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;cement&nbsp;sector&nbsp;and&nbsp;diversify&nbsp;its&nbsp;revenue&nbsp;base.&nbsp;The&nbsp;target&nbsp;facility&nbsp;has&nbsp;an&nbsp;annual&nbsp;production&nbsp;capacity&nbsp;of&nbsp;[X&nbsp;million&nbsp;tons]&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;currently&nbsp;operating&nbsp;at&nbsp;[X]%&nbsp;utilization.<\/p><p><strong>Key&nbsp;Terms:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Estimated&nbsp;transaction&nbsp;value:&nbsp;PKR&nbsp;[amount]&nbsp;\/&nbsp;USD&nbsp;[amount]<\/li><li>Structure:&nbsp;[Asset&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;\/&nbsp;Share&nbsp;purchase]<\/li><li>Expected&nbsp;completion&nbsp;timeline:&nbsp;[timeframe]<\/li><li>Financing:&nbsp;[Internal&nbsp;cash&nbsp;reserves&nbsp;\/&nbsp;Debt&nbsp;financing&nbsp;\/&nbsp;Mix]<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Rationale:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Increases&nbsp;installed&nbsp;cement&nbsp;production&nbsp;capacity&nbsp;by&nbsp;[X]%<\/li><li>Provides&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;[new&nbsp;regional&nbsp;market&nbsp;\/&nbsp;distribution&nbsp;network]<\/li><li>Expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;earnings&nbsp;accretive&nbsp;within&nbsp;[X]&nbsp;years<\/li><li>Synergies&nbsp;in&nbsp;raw&nbsp;material&nbsp;sourcing&nbsp;and&nbsp;logistics&nbsp;with&nbsp;existing&nbsp;operations<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Due&nbsp;Diligence&nbsp;Status:<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;Financial,&nbsp;legal,&nbsp;and&nbsp;technical&nbsp;due&nbsp;diligence&nbsp;is&nbsp;[in&nbsp;progress&nbsp;\/&nbsp;complete].&nbsp;Key&nbsp;findings:&nbsp;[summary].<\/p><p><strong>Risks:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Regulatory&nbsp;approval&nbsp;from&nbsp;Competition&nbsp;Commission&nbsp;of&nbsp;Pakistan&nbsp;(CCP)<\/li><li>Environmental&nbsp;compliance&nbsp;and&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;transfer<\/li><li>Integration&nbsp;and&nbsp;workforce&nbsp;transition&nbsp;risk<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Recommendation:<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;Management&nbsp;recommends&nbsp;approval&nbsp;to&nbsp;proceed&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;satisfactory&nbsp;completion&nbsp;of&nbsp;due&nbsp;diligence&nbsp;and&nbsp;receipt&nbsp;of&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;regulatory&nbsp;approvals.<\/p>","IsConfidential":false,"CreatedByUserId":"1e63ac53-3efd-4496-b01c-02e98c9453cb","CreatedAt":"2026-08-06T10:44:20.9349629","Status":"Approved","Token":"7C234F41-8A34-4F62-81BD-30594682CB73"},{"Id":4016,"Title":"Proposed Acquisition of Cement Manufacturing Facility","Category":1,"DescriptionHtml":"<p>This&nbsp;minute&nbsp;sheet&nbsp;seeks&nbsp;approval&nbsp;to&nbsp;proceed&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;of&nbsp;[Target&nbsp;Company\/Plant&nbsp;Name],&nbsp;a&nbsp;cement&nbsp;manufacturing&nbsp;facility&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;[location].<\/p><p><strong>Background:<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;The&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;aligns&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;company&#39;s&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;objective&nbsp;to&nbsp;expand&nbsp;its&nbsp;footprint&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;cement&nbsp;sector&nbsp;and&nbsp;diversify&nbsp;its&nbsp;revenue&nbsp;base.&nbsp;The&nbsp;target&nbsp;facility&nbsp;has&nbsp;an&nbsp;annual&nbsp;production&nbsp;capacity&nbsp;of&nbsp;[X&nbsp;million&nbsp;tons]&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;currently&nbsp;operating&nbsp;at&nbsp;[X]%&nbsp;utilization.<\/p><p><strong>Key&nbsp;Terms:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Estimated&nbsp;transaction&nbsp;value:&nbsp;PKR&nbsp;[amount]&nbsp;\/&nbsp;USD&nbsp;[amount]<\/li><li>Structure:&nbsp;[Asset&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;\/&nbsp;Share&nbsp;purchase]<\/li><li>Expected&nbsp;completion&nbsp;timeline:&nbsp;[timeframe]<\/li><li>Financing:&nbsp;[Internal&nbsp;cash&nbsp;reserves&nbsp;\/&nbsp;Debt&nbsp;financing&nbsp;\/&nbsp;Mix]<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Rationale:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Increases&nbsp;installed&nbsp;cement&nbsp;production&nbsp;capacity&nbsp;by&nbsp;[X]%<\/li><li>Provides&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;[new&nbsp;regional&nbsp;market&nbsp;\/&nbsp;distribution&nbsp;network]<\/li><li>Expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;earnings&nbsp;accretive&nbsp;within&nbsp;[X]&nbsp;years<\/li><li>Synergies&nbsp;in&nbsp;raw&nbsp;material&nbsp;sourcing&nbsp;and&nbsp;logistics&nbsp;with&nbsp;existing&nbsp;operations<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Due&nbsp;Diligence&nbsp;Status:<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;Financial,&nbsp;legal,&nbsp;and&nbsp;technical&nbsp;due&nbsp;diligence&nbsp;is&nbsp;[in&nbsp;progress&nbsp;\/&nbsp;complete].&nbsp;Key&nbsp;findings:&nbsp;[summary].<\/p><p><strong>Risks:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Regulatory&nbsp;approval&nbsp;from&nbsp;Competition&nbsp;Commission&nbsp;of&nbsp;Pakistan&nbsp;(CCP)<\/li><li>Environmental&nbsp;compliance&nbsp;and&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;transfer<\/li><li>Integration&nbsp;and&nbsp;workforce&nbsp;transition&nbsp;risk<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Recommendation:<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;Management&nbsp;recommends&nbsp;approval&nbsp;to&nbsp;proceed&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;satisfactory&nbsp;completion&nbsp;of&nbsp;due&nbsp;diligence&nbsp;and&nbsp;receipt&nbsp;of&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;regulatory&nbsp;approvals.<\/p>","Summary":"The minute sheet seeks board approval to acquire a cement manufacturing facility to expand the company’s footprint and diversify revenue. It outlines the transaction value, structure, financing, expected timeline, and strategic rationale, highlights due‑diligence status and key risks, and recommends proceeding only after satisfactory due‑diligence completion and regulatory approvals.","ActionItems":"[{\"task\":\"Complete financial due diligence\",\"owner\":\"Finance Team\",\"deadline\":\"30 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Complete legal due diligence\",\"owner\":\"Legal Team\",\"deadline\":\"30 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Complete technical due diligence\",\"owner\":\"Technical Team\",\"deadline\":\"30 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Obtain regulatory approval from Competition Commission of Pakistan (CCP)\",\"owner\":\"Regulatory Affairs Team\",\"deadline\":\"60 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Obtain environmental compliance and licensing transfer\",\"owner\":\"Environmental Compliance Team\",\"deadline\":\"60 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Plan integration and workforce transition\",\"owner\":\"Integration Manager\",\"deadline\":\"90 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Finalize financing structure (internal cash reserves \/ debt financing \/ mix)\",\"owner\":\"Chief Financial Officer (CFO)\",\"deadline\":\"45 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Draft and sign acquisition agreement\",\"owner\":\"Legal Team\",\"deadline\":\"60 days from meeting\"},{\"task\":\"Confirm expected completion timeline and update stakeholders\",\"owner\":\"Project Manager\",\"deadline\":\"15 days from meeting\"}]","NextMeetingAgenda":"[{\"topic\":\"Review and approval of the proposed acquisition of [Target Company\/Plant Name]\",\"owner\":\"Chief Executive Officer\",\"time_box\":\"20 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Status update on financial, legal, and technical due diligence\",\"owner\":\"Chief Financial Officer\",\"time_box\":\"15 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Discussion of key risks: regulatory approvals (CCP), environmental compliance, and integration challenges\",\"owner\":\"Head of Legal \\u0026 Compliance\",\"time_box\":\"15 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Financing structure and funding plan for the transaction\",\"owner\":\"Treasury Lead\",\"time_box\":\"10 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Next steps and timeline for completion, including conditions precedent\",\"owner\":\"Corporate Development Lead\",\"time_box\":\"10 mins\"}]","AttachmentFileName":"Cement_Acquisition_Minute_Sheet.pdf","AttachmentStoredPath":"uploads\/58f1f451254942a883fb04e6e3f56963.pdf","IsConfidential":false,"CreatedByUserId":"9d37b230-5f9a-4c3f-8504-a37096ab5a91","CreatedAt":"2026-08-06T10:58:44.5332303","Status":"Approved","Token":"5A1764E1-502F-4B97-9AF2-A858E5B26FDD"},{"Id":4017,"Title":"this is a test","Category":1,"DescriptionHtml":"<p>test<\/p>","IsConfidential":false,"CreatedByUserId":"1e63ac53-3efd-4496-b01c-02e98c9453cb","CreatedAt":"2026-08-06T11:31:09.6569337","Status":"Pending","Token":"FB258815-9416-4B3B-ABB3-0E2ED50D557E"},{"Id":4018,"Title":"This is a sheet","Category":1,"DescriptionHtml":"<p>Hello,&nbsp;I&nbsp;am&nbsp;Hamza&nbsp;and&nbsp;I&#39;m&nbsp;going&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;testing&nbsp;this&nbsp;minute&nbsp;sheet.&nbsp;Now&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;summarise&nbsp;the&nbsp;Sheet.&nbsp;<\/p>","Summary":"This minute sheet serves as a template for proposing the acquisition of a cement manufacturing facility to expand market footprint and diversify revenue. The proposal outlines the strategic rationale, including increased production capacity and potential synergies, while noting that due diligence is currently in progress. Approval is sought to proceed with the acquisition, subject to satisfactory due diligence and regulatory clearance from the Competition Commission of Pakistan.","NextMeetingAgenda":"[{\"topic\":\"Review previous meeting minutes and action items\",\"owner\":\"Hamza\",\"time_box\":\"10 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Progress update on current tasks\",\"owner\":\"Team Members\",\"time_box\":\"20 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Identification of blockers and challenges\",\"owner\":\"Team Members\",\"time_box\":\"15 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Goal setting and task allocation for next period\",\"owner\":\"Hamza\",\"time_box\":\"10 mins\"},{\"topic\":\"Any other business (AOB)\",\"owner\":\"All\",\"time_box\":\"5 mins\"}]","AttachmentFileName":"Cement_Acquisition_Minute_Sheet.pdf","AttachmentStoredPath":"uploads\/d4f3668351a94cb2835a6128762c58be.pdf","IsConfidential":false,"CreatedByUserId":"1e63ac53-3efd-4496-b01c-02e98c9453cb","CreatedAt":"2026-08-10T09:59:38.8927755","Status":"Approved","Token":"254198CF-7535-47FC-A52D-76B26780D61D"},{"Id":4019,"Title":"abc","Category":1,"Amount":908880.00,"Currency":"PKR","DescriptionHtml":"<blockquote>This&nbsp;minute&nbsp;sheet&nbsp;seeks&nbsp;approval&nbsp;to&nbsp;proceed&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;of&nbsp;[Target&nbsp;Company\/Plant&nbsp;Name],&nbsp;a&nbsp;cement&nbsp;manufacturing&nbsp;facility&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;[location].<\/blockquote><blockquote><strong>Background:<\/strong><\/blockquote><blockquote>&nbsp;The&nbsp;acquisition&nbsp;aligns&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;company&#39;s&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;objective&nbsp;to&nbsp;expand&nbsp;its&nbsp;footprint&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;cement&nbsp;sector&nbsp;and&nbsp;diversify&nbsp;its&nbsp;revenue&nbsp;base.&nbsp;The&nbsp;target&nbsp;facility&nbsp;has&nbsp;an&nbsp;annual&nbsp;production&nbsp;capacity&nbsp;of&nbsp;[X&nbsp;million&nbsp;tons]&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;currently&nbsp;operating&nbsp;at&nbsp;[X]%&nbsp;utilization.<\/blockquote><blockquote><strong>Key&nbsp;Terms:<\/strong><\/blockquote><ul><li>Estimated&nbsp;transaction&nbsp;value:&nbsp;PKR&nbsp;[amount]&nbsp;\/&nbsp;USD&nbsp;[amount]<\/li><li>Structure:&nbsp;[Asset&nbsp;purchase&nbsp